import { Observable } from 'rxjs';
interface UserProfile {
  name: string;
  age: Observable<number>;
  phoneNumber: string;
}

This interface merges traditional fields with reactive programming by making the 'age' field an Observable. You can subscribe to age changes, which is useful if age updates frequently.

